==Faliscan==
===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ine-pro|la}} {{m|ine-pro|*dʰeh₁-||to put, place, set}}, through an intermediate root *''dʰh₁-k-yé/ó-''. Cognate with {{etyl|la|-}} {{term|facio|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈfa.ki.oː/|lang=xfa}}
===Verb===
{{head|xfa|verb|head=faciō}}
# I [[make]]
